REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0012

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

PACE must warn its users when a newer engine version exists, including the
exact upgrade command to run -- the user should never have to check PyPI.

RAW_TEXT

Pero deberia haber un aviso de que hay una version nueva en pace y el link
del comando a ejecutar.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

Active Guardian behaviour: an update-check service queries PyPI for the
latest pace-engine version (short timeout, fail-silent when offline) and,
when a newer version exists, the handoff's Health checks section WARNs with
the exact command: pip install --upgrade pace-engine. No network, no error,
no delay beyond the timeout -- silence is the failure mode, never a crash.

PROMOTED_TO

F6-31 (pace/services/update_check.py + handoff health check)

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
